    "text": {
     "en": "The story teaches that cheating will not lead anywhere.\nThe Panchayat shows how wisdom and fairness solve problems without anger.\nThe chief did not argue with the neighbour's words. She accepted them and showed what they really meant.\nThe farmer trusted the village system and got justice.\n(additional, not in the textbook) Honesty is the best policy, and a fair decision means listening to both sides."
